{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
You who struggle, you who carry
Heavy [C]burdens day and [G]night
Hear how [C]Jesus calls you [G]to him
You are [D7]not forgotten [G]here
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Come to me, all you who are [C]weary
And burdened, come to [D7]me
And I will give you [G]rest
Come to me
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Take my yoke and learn from me
For I am [C]gentle and humble in [G]heart
And [C]you will find rest for your [G]souls
For my yoke is [D7]easy and my burden is [G]light
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

